 "title": "Cough and Covenant",
 "description": "A haunting portrait of frontier conviction and quiet sacrifice. In a dimly lit cabin, a wounded man lies coughing, caught between survival and surrender. Painterly light spills over weathered hands and a fevered face, while the shadows whisper of unseen consequences. Crafted with cinematic realism and rich historical detail, this Western fine art image invites deeper reflection with every glance.\n© Wayne Heim",
 "alt": "A dramatic, painterly Western scene of a man tending another on the floor, rendered in chiaroscuro light—fine art photography by Wayne Heim.",
