 "srcXL": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/West-Virginia/Hardwood/Hardwood-25/i-HBRmWg4/1/LccMBFCLj73PTPKtMP3K85QLWK6VPZKZVm4sjWCHJ/XL/_WHO0489-1089-2-XL.jpg",
